the point of an UnmarshalYAML/UnmarshalJSON receiver is to tell provide custom instructions for how to, given the byte data, fill in the struct (`*Member`).

I also probably wouldn't use this as a place to do data validation. YAML/JSON are data serialization mechanism. Once serialized/deserialized, _then_ validate what you have before continuing.

